1. **`InducesOn.mul`** (line 118): missing **`Measurable ⇑g'`** (only `hg : Measurable ⇑g`). `Measure.map_map` needs the outer map measurable. Confirmed genuinely false otherwise: with `g'` non-measurable, `h'` forces `P` to vanish on `range gbar'` only, and a `θ ∉ range gbar'` with `g'∘g` measurable gives `(Pθ).map ⇑(g'*g) ≠ 0 = P(ḡ'ḡθ)`. Fix = add `Measurable ⇑g'`.
